  "notable_quotes": [
    "Zn-DAT is a novel 3D microporous bifunctional MOF, {[Zn2(TDC)2(DATRZ)]·(3H2O)·(DMF)}n, synthesized solvothermally via a mixed-ligand strategy.",
    "Zn-DAT shows selective CO2 adsorption with a high Qst of 39.5 kJ mol−1, consistent with a theoretical binding energy of 40.9 kJ mol−1.",
    "The paper partially supports that basic –NH2 groups enhance both selective CO2 capture and conversion to cyclic carbonates, but this conclusion is shown for mild conditions only."
  ],
